      "message": "I rely on the log which somehow defines the path. Are you saying that this log is not reliable?\n\n\nplease note that flag `always_send_services_if_gatt_disc_done` is already enabled by default which means, empty uuids goes up in all cases, but not this one.\n\nHowever, I agree that processing empty uuids in btif_dm should be done only in the bonding context, so I did small improvement of my patch.",
